    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσοχο-ϊκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a goldsmith</i> or
				<i>gold-smelter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χ. πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					485a34
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργάζεσθαι χ. τέχνην</span>
			follow the trade <i>of a goldsmith,</i> Test. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.102
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχυρα χ.</span>
			<i>goldsmith's</i> dross, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				33
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσοχο-κή</span></b> , ἡ, <i>tax paid by goldsmiths,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				2p.141
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
